{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through unyielding hordes of ancient Nordic undeads. Set during WW2, you and up to <i><strong>3 other survivors</strong></i> must hold the line against the <strong>Draugar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draugar</strong> is a wave-based, first-person shooter. You start off with a basic pistol, and you must fight your way through the rounds to acquire cash. Use the cash you earn to buy firearms, grenades and various upgrades (such as a faster fire rate, more health and higher ammunition capacity) to give you the edge over the undeads.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.poster.avif?t=1756006050\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.webm?t=1756006050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.mp4?t=1756006050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ships with 3 different playable locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>1. Testing Facility </strong>(Indoor facility with a trampoline)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>2. Dreadmill Farm </strong>(Confined outdoor space with a big farmhouse and plenty of corn)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3. Blodhavn </strong>(A small-ish  rural church town)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to play some casual first person shoot-em-up game with your friends, <strong>Draugar</strong> might just be what you're looking for!</p>","ach